==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*2 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Madhead (Enemy)|Madhead]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Those Guys]] spawns.
**4 [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

